---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="AIspanda is a public learning and proof platform for practical AI strategy, engineering and delivery.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About AIspanda</p>
    <h1>Learn in public. Build reusable proof.</h1>
    <p class="lede">AIspanda documents how AI-enabled products are planned, designed, built, tested and operated—then turns useful lessons into assets others can inspect and reuse.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 1rem">
    <div class="shell audience-grid">
      <article class="audience-card"><b>For business leaders</b><h3>See the path to value.</h3><p>Understand what a small proof can establish, what it cannot, and which decisions deserve investment.</p></article>
      <article class="audience-card"><b>For technology leaders</b><h3>Inspect the system.</h3><p>Review architecture, governance, cost, scalability, portability and operational consequences.</p></article>
      <article class="audience-card"><b>For builders</b><h3>Reuse the work.</h3><p>Start with practical templates, code, tools, prompts and quality checks instead of a blank page.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="shell section-head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Long-term direction</p><h2>A credible AI delivery brand, built one proof at a time.</h2></div>
      <p>Over time, AIspanda will grow from articles and assets into a place where practitioners can discuss, improve and contribute reusable work. Community features will follow real demand and responsible operating capacity.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
